@startuml state-shift
!include style.iuml
hide empty description

state Open : entry / record clock-in time and station
state Open : do / accrue worked minutes

state Closed : entry / compute duration and lateness
state Closed : entry / update live roster

state AutoClosed : entry / set clock-out = clock-in + 8 h
state AutoClosed : entry / flag for payroll review

[*] --> Open : badgeTapped [no open shift] / create shift
Open --> Closed : badgeTapped / record clock-out time
Open --> Closed : forceClockOut(reason) / record clock-out time and reason
Open --> Closed : stationReassigned / record clock-out time; open shift at new station
Open --> AutoClosed : nightlyCheck [open > 16 h] / closeReason = "auto_closed"
Closed --> [*]
AutoClosed --> [*] : payrollReviewed
@enduml
